{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a fractured Earth, every fight happens in two places at once. As the commander of an elite task force, you operate across interwoven planes, using Duality Swap to move units and terrain between sides for decisive finishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the battlefield, you\u2019ll explore open regions, gather allies and artifacts, and expand your HQ to turn impossible fronts into winnable campaigns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881620/extras/ee49b9b74cecdb91f5486fd963abd0b5.avif?t=1760487836\" width=780 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881620/extras/0b8fa4f9461d441a39ae132da90dc163.poster.avif?t=1760487836\" width=780 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881620/extras/0b8fa4f9461d441a39ae132da90dc163.webm?t=1760487836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Duality Swap to shift units and objects between planes, bypassing obstacles, isolating foes, and opening new lines of attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate actions on both sides of the map to set traps, rescue teammates, and secure hard-to-reach objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each plane carries its own hazards and boons that shape the flow of every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881620/extras/42607c7da2a836c407e662aeabf1376f.avif?t=1760487836\" width=780 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881620/extras/2f1bc08dcd78c63b63ab0a2dfde42bbb.poster.avif?t=1760487836\" width=780 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881620/extras/2f1bc08dcd78c63b63ab0a2dfde42bbb.webm?t=1760487836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surround Consume: encircle enemies with smart swaps and positioning to trigger an instant execution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create openings to break elites: split the field, cut off reinforcements, or collapse the backline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether cunning plans or up-close combat, there isn\u2019t just one path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881620/extras/6eeb1811d075262b4578c0c6231fb4d0.avif?t=1760487836\" width=780 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881620/extras/2d4d6269b74294be6906d729fc43f1cf.poster.avif?t=1760487836\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881620/extras/2d4d6269b74294be6906d729fc43f1cf.webm?t=1760487836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push the front line to meet new factions, unlock side quests, and resolve dynamic events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt rare threats for valuable drops, and uncover ruins and anomalies tied to the Duality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape routes, risk, and reward, and can even steer a civilization\u2019s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881620/extras/bb1a17d793fbbe1b0614a24c190bf329.avif?t=1760487836\" width=780 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881620/extras/fc05a7720b92c461612e013caddb3dd9.poster.avif?t=1760487836\" width=780 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881620/extras/fc05a7720b92c461612e013caddb3dd9.webm?t=1760487836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build HQ facilities across research, engineering, military training, and diplomacy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deepen arcane studies to expand Duality Swap and unlock advanced tactical options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit officers and operatives, host visiting specialists, and strengthen faction relations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881620/extras/718d810c9f5ca7037377f9cbb0d9414f.avif?t=1760487836\" width=780 height=110 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refit units with new arms and train distinctive arcane specializations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect enemy-dropped Echoes\u2014over a hundred unique abilities\u2014to craft your builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire powerful Relics that transform tactics, from mobility engines to execution chains.</p></li></u